          "method": "production_trial",
          "reviewer": "APD-v3.2-learning-patch",
          "reviewed_at": "2026-09-11",
          "notes": "User-proposed method to trade invisible fine anatomy for physically plausible turbulence while preserving proportions."
        }
      }
    },
    {
