        "line": 14,
        "text": "Do not carry subject demographics, nationality, ethnicity, gender, wardrobe, brand, or other content locks from a previous task into a new task unless the current brief explicitly inherits them. Current-task source material may inform only the dimensions the user asked to preserve."
      },
